WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.200
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.280 --> 01:40.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:59.680 --> 02:00.520
Hao.

02:43.000 --> 02:43.880
I…

02:44.400 --> 02:45.440
What have I done?

02:47.200 --> 02:48.360
Hao.

02:48.440 --> 02:49.360
What have I done?

02:50.400 --> 02:51.720
What have I done?

02:54.480 --> 02:55.720
Master.

03:13.960 --> 03:15.760
What's wrong, my old friend?

03:16.440 --> 03:17.880
You don't seem very satisfied.

03:17.960 --> 03:19.520
What happened to my master?

03:19.600 --> 03:20.920
She is alive

03:21.000 --> 03:22.640
and at your side, isn't she?

03:23.120 --> 03:24.520
And the way she is now

03:24.600 --> 03:26.760
is what you asked me for, isn't it?

03:26.840 --> 03:28.080
Nonsense!

03:28.160 --> 03:29.880
Thirty thousand years ago,

03:29.960 --> 03:31.920
didn't you beg me to use evil qi

03:32.000 --> 03:34.080
to amass the wisp of her primordial spirit

03:34.160 --> 03:36.080
and send her
to the Mortal World for tribulations?

03:36.160 --> 03:38.920
Those tainted with evil qi
change drastically.

03:39.000 --> 03:41.360
Haven't you seen it
with your own eyes before?

03:41.440 --> 03:43.400
But why are others tainted with evil qi

03:43.480 --> 03:45.160
only temporarily bloodthirsty?

03:45.720 --> 03:48.120
No one was ever like my master,

03:48.200 --> 03:50.320
so pained, insane,

03:50.400 --> 03:52.000
and endlessly thirsting for evil qi.

03:52.080 --> 03:55.840
Her primordial spirit has been nourished
by evil qi for 30,000 years

03:55.920 --> 03:59.200
and has long
since been thoroughly corroded.

03:59.920 --> 04:02.240
If she wants to keep living,

04:02.320 --> 04:04.760
she has to keep absorbing evil qi

04:04.840 --> 04:08.200
until her primordial spirit
is completely taken over by it.

04:08.280 --> 04:09.520
She will lose her power,

04:09.600 --> 04:10.880
memories,

04:10.960 --> 04:11.840
and consciousness,

04:11.920 --> 04:13.640
ultimately becoming a killing monster

04:13.720 --> 04:16.640
that is no better than beasts and demons.

04:17.680 --> 04:18.680
How can that be?

04:20.959 --> 04:22.000
It was you.

04:23.040 --> 04:25.040
I've already helped you find the goddess

04:25.120 --> 04:26.320
and break the seal.

04:26.400 --> 04:28.280
I did everything you asked of me!

04:28.840 --> 04:30.640
But why did you break your promise

04:31.160 --> 04:32.520
and harmed my master to this point?

04:33.160 --> 04:35.320
Do not rush, old friend.

04:35.800 --> 04:37.480
There is one last step

04:37.560 --> 04:39.360
before I have delivered on my promise.

04:39.880 --> 04:40.760
What is it?

04:40.840 --> 04:43.560
After I take your master's immortal body

04:43.640 --> 04:45.560
and merge with her primordial spirit,

04:45.640 --> 04:47.720
she will be free.

04:48.280 --> 04:51.080
If your primordial spirit
occupies my master's immortal body,

04:51.600 --> 04:53.360
my master would become

04:53.440 --> 04:55.120
a senseless puppet!

04:55.880 --> 04:58.280
Do you think of me
as a mere primordial spirit?

04:59.320 --> 05:01.240
You underestimate me.

05:01.320 --> 05:03.400
I am Taisui, the ancient Evil God.

05:03.480 --> 05:05.440
I'm unlike any living being
in the three realms.

05:05.520 --> 05:06.880
In other words,

05:06.960 --> 05:09.440
I'm not any ordinary living creature.

05:09.520 --> 05:11.000
Then what are you?

05:11.080 --> 05:12.720
I have told you before.

05:12.800 --> 05:14.560
I am the darkest desires and fantasies

05:14.640 --> 05:17.320
at the bottom of every person's heart.

05:18.240 --> 05:21.440
I was born in the hearts
of all beings in the three realms.

05:21.520 --> 05:24.480
Naturally, I also exist
in your master's heart.

05:25.080 --> 05:26.680
Even if I merge with her,

05:26.760 --> 05:28.960
she would still be Lady Chidi.

05:29.040 --> 05:31.760
She will still remember
her entire past with you,

05:31.840 --> 05:35.040
but she won't be in such pain anymore.

05:35.880 --> 05:37.800
She can live in seclusion with you,

05:37.880 --> 05:39.720
play the zither, and practice swords.

05:41.320 --> 05:42.200
No.

05:43.080 --> 05:45.040
I will never trust you again.

05:46.640 --> 05:48.440
You will.

05:49.240 --> 05:52.520
Because you don't have any other choice.

06:00.440 --> 06:01.600
In the past,

06:02.080 --> 06:03.520
I often combed your hair.

06:05.160 --> 06:06.520
Your black hair is fine as silk.

06:07.760 --> 06:09.400
It's as if you will never grow old.

06:11.040 --> 06:11.960
Hao.

06:13.760 --> 06:14.840
Kill me.

06:20.440 --> 06:21.760
Master, do you remember?

06:23.680 --> 06:25.560
I once made a mistake when I was young.

06:26.640 --> 06:28.320
And you didn't punish me.

06:29.400 --> 06:30.240
Instead, you--

06:30.320 --> 06:32.000
Hao, let me die.

06:32.960 --> 06:34.280
End my suffering.

06:35.360 --> 06:37.040
I don't want to live like this anymore.

06:40.400 --> 06:41.280
Master.

06:44.640 --> 06:46.000
I've thought it through.

06:47.560 --> 06:48.760
From now on,

06:49.760 --> 06:51.080
I will help you

06:51.920 --> 06:53.600
refine the evil qi every day.

06:53.680 --> 06:54.760
Anyway,

06:55.840 --> 06:57.080
that is what I've done every day

06:57.600 --> 06:58.720
for the past 30,000 years.

07:00.080 --> 07:01.040
It's easy.

07:01.840 --> 07:02.680
Right?

07:05.560 --> 07:07.600
Have you made up your mind,

07:08.280 --> 07:09.360
Ronghao?

07:09.960 --> 07:12.000
If you take over Master's immortal body

07:13.440 --> 07:14.880
and merge with her primordial spirit,

07:16.640 --> 07:18.160
will she no longer be in pain?

07:19.440 --> 07:20.480
That's right.

07:22.840 --> 07:25.240
And I get to stay by her side.

07:26.480 --> 07:27.360
Forever.

07:28.280 --> 07:29.240
That's right.

07:29.920 --> 07:31.120
You will never be

07:31.200 --> 07:33.040
separated from her again.

07:33.120 --> 07:34.800
You had better not break your promise.

07:36.920 --> 07:38.880
I never break my promises.

07:42.600 --> 07:43.480
Hao,

07:44.600 --> 07:45.960
it's time.

07:56.120 --> 07:57.040
Master.

07:59.120 --> 08:00.800
Taisui will find this place soon.

08:02.080 --> 08:03.160
From now on,

08:03.880 --> 08:05.440
you will never be in pain.

08:06.840 --> 08:08.080
Hao, what are you going to do?

08:10.400 --> 08:12.480
As long as Taisui merges
with your primordial spirit

08:13.440 --> 08:14.840
and occupies your immortal body,

08:15.920 --> 08:17.400
you will be free.

08:18.280 --> 08:19.720
You will no longer suffer

08:20.720 --> 08:22.240
and you will never leave me again.

08:23.280 --> 08:24.400
No.

08:32.640 --> 08:34.120
Your earthly desires are too fervent.

08:34.200 --> 08:35.679
That's why you were bewitched by Taisui

08:35.760 --> 08:37.600
and couldn't see
that fate is predetermined.

08:38.159 --> 08:39.240
I beg of you.

08:39.799 --> 08:41.120
Don't make more mistakes.

08:41.200 --> 08:42.960
I was originally a mortal.

08:43.039 --> 08:44.520
My earthly desires can never be erased.

08:44.600 --> 08:45.960
I don't understand fate

08:46.040 --> 08:46.960
nor do I want to.

08:47.520 --> 08:48.400
Hao.

08:49.240 --> 08:50.760
Your spiritual wisdom is unparalleled.

08:51.720 --> 08:53.120
You were born a high god.

08:54.760 --> 08:57.320
You only care about the three realms

08:57.400 --> 08:59.200
and don't understand what I am thinking.

09:03.840 --> 09:05.960
I merely had a tiny earthly desire.

09:07.640 --> 09:09.600
It was a wish for you to be alive.

09:11.240 --> 09:12.800
As long as you can live,

09:13.920 --> 09:15.560
I am willing to do anything.

09:17.120 --> 09:18.560
Why is it that

09:19.200 --> 09:20.840
not even destroying heaven and earth

09:22.640 --> 09:24.600
can fulfill such a small and simple wish?

09:32.560 --> 09:33.440
Hao.

09:36.120 --> 09:38.000
I once had an earthly desire.

10:19.360 --> 10:21.920
This guest has been sitting
by the window for three days.

10:22.000 --> 10:22.920
Yes.

10:24.000 --> 10:24.920
It's freezing outside.

10:25.000 --> 10:26.880
That blind boy outside
might not survive the day.

10:26.960 --> 10:29.280
- Don't die at our door. That's unlucky.
- Let's go.

11:02.720 --> 11:04.560
But you still had a kind heart.

11:05.880 --> 11:07.640
You saved me on that wintry day.

11:40.960 --> 11:42.320
I asked Lady Arbiter

11:43.160 --> 11:45.640
to teach me how to resurrect the dead.

11:45.720 --> 11:48.200
The dead cannot be brought back to life.

11:48.280 --> 11:49.480
This is an immutable law.

11:49.560 --> 11:51.240
If you must resurrect the dead,

11:51.320 --> 11:52.520
it is bound to bring disaster.

11:53.480 --> 11:54.600
Even if you are a high god,

11:54.680 --> 11:55.800
you are no exception.

11:56.360 --> 11:57.320
High God Chidi,

11:57.400 --> 11:58.440
have you

12:00.240 --> 12:01.560
really made up your mind?

12:02.360 --> 12:03.240
Yes.

12:04.720 --> 12:06.240
Please help me.

12:07.520 --> 12:08.600
Whatever the price is,

12:09.480 --> 12:11.080
I will pay for it.

12:12.680 --> 12:13.880
What if the price consigns you

12:15.320 --> 12:17.040
to eternal damnation one day?

12:19.280 --> 12:20.200
Will you regret it?

13:10.280 --> 13:11.680
Did you have an earthly desire

13:13.120 --> 13:14.040
for my sake?

13:15.200 --> 13:16.080
Yes.

13:18.240 --> 13:19.240
It was for you.

14:44.240 --> 14:45.520
What are you doing?

14:46.720 --> 14:47.560
What am I doing?

14:48.600 --> 14:49.960
Didn't we agree on this?

14:51.120 --> 14:52.280
From now on,

14:53.240 --> 14:54.840
my master will no longer be in pain.

14:55.400 --> 14:58.240
You have already planned all this.

14:58.320 --> 14:59.680
How dare you deceive me?

14:59.760 --> 15:00.680
That's right.

15:01.800 --> 15:03.240
I lured you here

15:04.320 --> 15:05.960
so that I can blow up my primordial spirit

15:07.120 --> 15:08.680
and take you out with me.

15:09.480 --> 15:10.720
Ronghao!

15:13.160 --> 15:14.520
This is the last step left.

15:16.680 --> 15:18.880
Then I can be with my master forever,

15:21.120 --> 15:22.160
never to be parted again.

15:26.480 --> 15:28.120
You overestimate yourself.

15:28.200 --> 15:29.640
I am indestructible.

15:29.720 --> 15:31.400
Back in the day, the first goddess, Wuqi,

15:31.480 --> 15:32.680
blew up her primordial spirit

15:32.760 --> 15:34.520
and only managed to seal me.

15:34.600 --> 15:36.280
To think a mere nobody

15:36.360 --> 15:39.080
is trying to take me out with him!

15:59.080 --> 15:59.960
Master.

16:02.640 --> 16:03.560
I'm sorry.

16:32.960 --> 16:33.920
It's Taisui.

16:37.800 --> 16:40.360
He seems furious.

16:48.320 --> 16:49.200
Ronghao,

16:50.240 --> 16:52.080
now that you are buried with your master,

16:52.560 --> 16:53.880
you got your wish.

16:54.640 --> 16:55.480
From now on,

16:55.960 --> 16:57.120
every time I visit you,

16:57.720 --> 16:59.080
I'll bring you some wine.

17:14.760 --> 17:15.599
Chidi,

17:17.160 --> 17:19.160
you were my only worthy opponent.

17:20.720 --> 17:22.240
It's a pity that we won't fight again.

17:32.040 --> 17:33.760
Taisui has appeared

17:33.840 --> 17:35.120
and is wreaking havoc everywhere.

17:36.240 --> 17:37.120
Changheng,

17:37.840 --> 17:38.880
what we have to do

17:39.520 --> 17:40.600
can't be delayed any longer.

17:46.880 --> 17:48.200
The Magical Firefly Stone.

17:55.360 --> 17:56.360
Goddess,

17:57.160 --> 17:58.680
you are very knowledgeable.

17:59.240 --> 18:00.440
I once had a thought.

18:03.960 --> 18:05.880
It would be nice if I could pluck a star

18:06.560 --> 18:08.640
and carry it as a lantern at night.

18:09.200 --> 18:10.120
At that time,

18:10.680 --> 18:12.680
a friend told me

18:14.560 --> 18:16.680
that this kind of Spirit Jade
in the Northernmost Ocean

18:18.200 --> 18:19.920
is just like a star.

18:21.320 --> 18:22.920
So are you Goddess Xiyun

18:23.000 --> 18:23.880
or Orchid?

18:24.440 --> 18:26.000
I am Goddess Xiyun

18:26.760 --> 18:28.160
and also Orchid.

18:29.880 --> 18:31.000
I remember everything

18:31.680 --> 18:32.760
in my two lives.

18:34.680 --> 18:36.080
Since you remember everything,

18:36.600 --> 18:37.480
why…

18:40.480 --> 18:41.320
Could it be

18:42.080 --> 18:43.360
that you no longer love him?

18:43.440 --> 18:44.360
Or is it that

18:45.000 --> 18:46.080
you love me?

18:58.680 --> 19:00.040
You still love him.

19:01.680 --> 19:02.560
Then

19:03.920 --> 19:05.320
why did you agree to marry me?

19:06.760 --> 19:07.960
The creator, Lord Dong,

19:08.960 --> 19:10.960
once made a covenant with the Xilan Tribe.

19:11.440 --> 19:13.080
Only marriage between the two tribes

19:13.160 --> 19:14.360
can activate the godly power.

19:15.440 --> 19:16.320
As a result,

19:17.800 --> 19:20.240
the two tribes have protected
the three realms for generations.

19:20.320 --> 19:22.400
That is why we were betrothed.

19:23.640 --> 19:25.840
This is a duty that we cannot shirk.

19:28.480 --> 19:30.440
Now that Taisui has escaped from his seal,

19:30.920 --> 19:32.680
the three realms are in imminent peril.

19:33.440 --> 19:35.160
I need to attain supreme godly power

19:35.240 --> 19:36.720
to destroy him once and for all.

19:37.280 --> 19:39.160
Whether you like it or not,

19:40.400 --> 19:41.960
this is the only way.

19:46.480 --> 19:47.480
And afterward?

19:50.680 --> 19:51.640
What do you mean?

19:52.120 --> 19:54.200
Goddess Wuqi drained her primordial spirit

19:54.280 --> 19:55.840
and died trying to annihilate Taisui.

19:56.320 --> 19:58.320
If you try to destroy Taisui completely,

19:58.800 --> 20:00.160
what will be the consequence?

20:01.920 --> 20:03.880
Why do you pretend to know nothing

20:03.960 --> 20:05.600
and refuse to reunite
with Dongfang Qingcang?

20:08.080 --> 20:09.160
You will die,

20:11.240 --> 20:12.440
won't you?

20:14.840 --> 20:15.680
Yes.

20:24.480 --> 20:26.160
You and Dongfang Qingcang love each other.

20:27.440 --> 20:28.960
You would rather lie to him

20:29.520 --> 20:31.560
than let him suffer another ounce of pain.

20:33.400 --> 20:34.280
But what about me?

20:36.760 --> 20:37.640
How can you…

20:38.720 --> 20:39.840
How can you make me marry you

20:39.920 --> 20:41.360
and then send you off to die?

20:42.160 --> 20:43.680
Have you considered my feelings?

20:44.480 --> 20:45.360
Changheng.

20:47.440 --> 20:48.280
I'm sorry.

20:49.520 --> 20:50.680
I don't need an apology.

20:51.640 --> 20:53.480
You know an apology isn't what I want.

20:55.640 --> 20:56.760
Are you also going to tell me

20:56.840 --> 20:58.240
that you don't have a choice?

20:58.800 --> 20:59.640
No.

21:01.560 --> 21:02.800
I have chosen

21:02.880 --> 21:04.600
to be the Goddess of Xishan.

21:08.800 --> 21:10.960
From the moment I came back to life,

21:12.840 --> 21:15.080
I chose to let go of all personal feelings

21:15.880 --> 21:17.880
and accept the duty
of protecting all living beings.

21:21.920 --> 21:22.840
Changheng,

21:26.200 --> 21:27.720
you are the only one who can help me.

21:28.800 --> 21:31.240
But it is your life
that you're asking me to sacrifice.

21:38.960 --> 21:39.880
I can't do it.

21:41.600 --> 21:42.960
I can't do it.

21:43.040 --> 21:43.920
Changheng,

21:44.720 --> 21:46.000
you must help me.

22:27.520 --> 22:29.440
Aside from Chidi,

22:29.520 --> 22:30.640
Dongfang Qingcang is the only one

22:30.720 --> 22:32.640
whose body is compatible with Taisui.

22:32.720 --> 22:34.040
Now that Chidi is dead,

22:34.120 --> 22:35.400
I'm afraid his next target

22:36.440 --> 22:37.920
is Dongfang Qingcang.

22:39.280 --> 22:40.400
Yes.

22:41.840 --> 22:43.480
Are you really going to sacrifice yourself

22:43.560 --> 22:44.680
to protect him?

22:44.760 --> 22:46.200
I love all living beings.

22:48.520 --> 22:49.640
And I love one person.

23:08.360 --> 23:09.560
Goddess.

23:10.640 --> 23:11.800
What is it?

23:11.880 --> 23:13.040
Don't worry.

23:14.320 --> 23:15.760
I understand now.

23:17.000 --> 23:18.800
You are not Orchid.

23:19.360 --> 23:20.680
Orchid is already

23:22.400 --> 23:23.360
truly gone.

23:24.240 --> 23:26.360
Your wedding with Changheng is tomorrow.

23:28.040 --> 23:30.200
I won't bother you again in the future.

23:32.240 --> 23:34.040
But before I leave Xishan,

23:35.200 --> 23:36.560
I want to ask you

23:38.720 --> 23:40.040
for one last favor.

23:52.960 --> 23:54.280
This Lovesickness Bridge

23:55.160 --> 23:57.680
was where Orchid and I pledged our love.

24:03.360 --> 24:04.760
Why did you bring me here?

24:08.280 --> 24:11.960
ORCHID

24:12.040 --> 24:13.280
Legend has it

24:14.400 --> 24:17.280
that if two people hang a Love Lock
on the Lovesickness Bridge,

24:19.320 --> 24:20.920
they can be together

24:22.200 --> 24:23.560
for eternity.

24:24.560 --> 24:25.520
That night,

24:26.080 --> 24:27.920
we were going to hang this lock.

24:28.600 --> 24:30.160
Unfortunately, we didn't get to.

24:38.000 --> 24:40.120
So I hope you don't mind me asking you

24:41.760 --> 24:43.280
to hang this lock with me.

24:45.360 --> 24:46.320
This way--

24:46.400 --> 24:47.480
She is no longer here.

24:48.880 --> 24:50.480
She can't be with you.

24:52.280 --> 24:54.000
I see no need to hang the lock.

24:54.080 --> 24:55.000
There is.

24:58.360 --> 24:59.720
Although she is gone,

25:03.120 --> 25:04.920
I will never forget her.

25:10.200 --> 25:12.920
ORCHID

25:13.000 --> 25:15.160
I will guard the memories
of the two of us.

25:17.480 --> 25:19.320
That is also a way of being together.

25:23.560 --> 25:25.520
You have a long life ahead of you.

25:26.120 --> 25:27.200
There are countless beauties

25:27.280 --> 25:28.240
in the three realms.

25:28.720 --> 25:29.880
Is there no one else

25:30.720 --> 25:32.080
to your liking?

25:34.040 --> 25:34.880
No.

25:38.880 --> 25:40.120
There never will be.

25:41.520 --> 25:42.760
Not in this lifetime

25:43.920 --> 25:44.960
or any lifetime to come.

25:45.960 --> 25:46.960
She is the only one.

25:59.280 --> 26:01.600
She is but an orchid.

26:02.960 --> 26:04.560
Why can't you forget her?

26:05.040 --> 26:06.080
You don't understand.

26:08.480 --> 26:09.840
You will never understand

26:10.480 --> 26:11.520
the feelings between us.

26:17.560 --> 26:18.440
In this world,

26:19.160 --> 26:20.520
everyone hates me,

26:21.080 --> 26:22.160
fears me,

26:22.240 --> 26:23.480
relies on me,

26:23.560 --> 26:24.760
and admires me.

26:28.240 --> 26:29.280
She was the only one

26:31.680 --> 26:32.600
who loved me.

26:35.560 --> 26:37.160
She helped me through the difficulties.

26:38.080 --> 26:39.720
She helped me repair my root of emotion.

26:40.960 --> 26:42.960
Even if she made an enemy of the world,

26:45.600 --> 26:47.080
she would follow me.

26:47.560 --> 26:48.560
And I…

26:49.200 --> 26:50.320
I was full of thorns.

26:51.120 --> 26:52.480
I only made her sad.

26:53.640 --> 26:54.760
I'm a jerk.

26:56.920 --> 26:57.760
But she

27:00.720 --> 27:01.960
is a fool.

27:03.080 --> 27:04.840
She knew how wicked I was,

27:05.680 --> 27:07.600
but she made every excuse to forgive me

27:09.400 --> 27:10.520
and hold me tight

27:13.960 --> 27:15.320
even if it hurt.

27:16.800 --> 27:17.720
How I want her to know

27:17.800 --> 27:20.000
that I'm not that jerk anymore.

27:21.400 --> 27:22.560
I will love her,

27:23.320 --> 27:24.200
protect her,

27:24.920 --> 27:27.120
and not let her suffer anymore.

27:33.640 --> 27:35.160
But I don't have that chance anymore.

27:36.400 --> 27:37.320
Stop talking.

27:55.520 --> 27:56.440
I…

27:58.120 --> 27:59.560
I shouldn't have asked you to come.

28:01.160 --> 28:02.920
Although you look like her,

28:03.680 --> 28:04.760
you are not her.

28:05.560 --> 28:07.360
I can hang the lock myself.

28:07.960 --> 28:09.280
She will always be in my heart.

28:12.560 --> 28:13.560
She and I

28:14.640 --> 28:16.240
will never be apart.

28:32.080 --> 28:34.320
ORCHID

28:34.880 --> 28:36.760
Now you will never know

28:38.600 --> 28:40.640
that I'm not that wicked anymore.

28:42.000 --> 28:44.640
The Bone Orchid was consuming
your primordial spirit.

28:46.160 --> 28:48.160
The only way to break the Bone Orchid

28:49.920 --> 28:51.040
and save your life

28:52.120 --> 28:53.760
was to make you stop loving me.

28:55.160 --> 28:57.240
That is why I deliberately lied to you

28:57.320 --> 28:58.520
and humiliated you.

28:59.000 --> 29:01.160
It was to make you stop loving me.

29:14.120 --> 29:15.640
Why did you still love me

29:15.720 --> 29:17.160
up to the moment you died?

30:01.960 --> 30:03.240
I've stayed long enough.

30:04.520 --> 30:05.920
I should return to the Cangyan Sea.

30:06.400 --> 30:08.320
I wish you a blissful marriage.

30:10.120 --> 30:11.040
Goodbye.

30:13.880 --> 30:14.840
Wait.

30:21.280 --> 30:22.680
Is there anything else?

30:57.880 --> 30:58.960
Look.

30:59.040 --> 31:00.840
You look good when you smile like this.

31:03.120 --> 31:04.600
Like this.

31:06.080 --> 31:07.080
Do you remember?

31:08.880 --> 31:10.120
Remember?

31:16.280 --> 31:17.280
Smile.

31:31.080 --> 31:32.120
It's you.

31:34.040 --> 31:34.960
Who are you?

31:37.640 --> 31:38.520
Why?

32:11.040 --> 32:12.000
Take this.

32:18.600 --> 32:19.640
A Destiny Book.

32:19.720 --> 32:21.080
This is Orchid's Destiny Book.

32:23.160 --> 32:24.840
When the Xilan Tribe was massacred,

32:24.920 --> 32:26.720
her tribesmen sealed her into a seed

32:26.800 --> 32:27.840
and entrusted her to me.

32:28.720 --> 32:29.640
However,

32:30.200 --> 32:32.400
I was only able
to disguise her as an orchid.

32:33.160 --> 32:35.320
But I was unable to reshape her fate.

32:48.360 --> 32:49.600
A new fate has sprouted

32:50.600 --> 32:52.160
in her Destiny Book.

32:52.640 --> 32:54.600
But she clearly told me

32:56.080 --> 32:58.160
the fate of high gods is the most stable.

32:59.760 --> 33:01.280
It does not change easily.

33:12.120 --> 33:13.240
Her fate is severed.

33:22.320 --> 33:24.440
She intends to die with Taisui.

33:31.360 --> 33:32.600
At the end of the end,

33:33.400 --> 33:35.480
the one who can change the fate for her

33:35.960 --> 33:37.200
is you,

33:39.200 --> 33:40.520
Dongfang Qingcang.

33:40.600 --> 33:41.680
I understand.

33:45.320 --> 33:46.760
I will do anything

33:48.280 --> 33:49.520
to revive her.

33:49.600 --> 33:50.680
No.

33:54.520 --> 33:55.560
You don't understand yet.

33:57.280 --> 33:58.760
The end of the end.

34:01.440 --> 34:03.520
So this is the real end.

34:19.840 --> 34:20.719
My lord.

34:21.760 --> 34:22.960
It's time to go.

34:34.840 --> 34:36.360
For her,

34:38.639 --> 34:39.920
I will alter fate.

37:01.440 --> 37:02.400
My lord.

37:45.600 --> 37:46.960
The auspicious hour is upon us.
